Type: Review},
	keywords = {Large language model, Natural languages, Language model, Health care, Deep learning, Language processing, Learning systems, Clinical natural language processing, Digital storage, Document summarization, Electronic document exchange, Machine learning techniques, Medical computing, Medical documents, Storage sharing, Summarization},
