Type: Article},
	keywords = {User study, Human computer interaction, Language model, Model-based OPC, Human engineering, 'Dry' [, Daily tasks, Dynamic tasks, Exploratory studies, Large language model-based conversational assistant, Real-world experience, User perceptions},
