Type: Review},
	keywords = {large language model, Large language model, deep learning, fairness, artificial intelligence, Decision making, reliability, Behavioral research, Language model, Diagnosis, human, information processing, workflow, Medical computing, clinical decision support system, decision making, Ethical technology, Decision support systems, Ethical considerations, Clinical decision support, Security of data, Data reliability, cognition, Review, systematic review, bias mitigation, Biological microelectromechanical system, BioMEMS, biosensor reading, Biosensors, blood pressure, Blood pressure, chronic disease, clinical effectiveness, data breach, drug delivery system, eHealth, electronic consultation, emergency, emotion, encryption, extreme environment, Firmware, health care cost, health care delivery, heart rate, information security, medical ethics, medical history, Micro-electro-mechanical, noise, patient engagement, Patient monitoring, personalized care, postoperative care, Psychophysiology, Remote monitoring, resource allocation, risk, Smart wearables, telehealth, Telehealth, trustworthy artificial intelligence, Trustworthy artificial intelligence, Wearable technology},
